This directory contains an adaptation of question data from RepoQA by the EvalPlus
project: https://github.com/evalplus/repoqa
Data release: https://github.com/evalplus/repoqa_release/releases/tag/2024-06-23
Original data license: Apache License 2.0 (included in LICENSE).

Changes made by Structure-Aware Code Retrieval and Evaluation:
- Select all ten Python needles belonging to marshmallow-code/marshmallow.
- Retain their descriptions verbatim, while assigning project-specific query IDs.
- Map designated functions into graded symbol qrels with verified source bounds.
- Add provenance hashes, repository metadata and a distinct retrieval protocol.

This adaptation is not the upstream RepoQA evaluation or leaderboard protocol.
Marshmallow source remains subject to its own MIT license; source code is not
included in these committed data files.
